---
import Page from "../layouts/Page.astro";
---
<Page title="Brand" theme="dark" current="none">
<div class="br-pg br-root">
  <div>
  <!-- Hero -->
  <section class="br-wrap br-s1">
    <div class="br-s2">
      <span class="br-eyebrow">Brand</span>
      <h1 class="br-h1">Writing about doze? Here is how it looks and talks.</h1>
      <p class="br-lede">The bats, the colours, the type and the words, in one place, so a slide, a blog post or a README looks like the rest of the family. Take what you need; no permission form.</p>
      <div class="br-stack-sm br-s3">
        <a class="br-btn br-btn-lamp" href="#assets">Download the icons</a>
        <a class="br-btn br-btn-ghost" href="#voice">How we write</a>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="br-hero-art br-s4">
      <div class="br-s5"></div>
      <div class="br-hero-row br-s6">
        <img class="br-tile-sm br-s7" src="/brand/doze-aws.svg" alt="">
        <img class="br-tile-lg br-s8" src="/brand/doze.svg" alt="The doze icon: a sleeping bat hanging from a branch on an amber tile">
        <img class="br-tile-sm br-s7" src="/brand/doze-kafka.svg" alt="">
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Names -->
  <section class="br-s9">
    <div class="br-wrap br-sec br-s10">
      <div class="br-s11">
        <span class="br-eyebrow">The names</span>
        <h2 class="br-h2">doze is lower case. Always, even first in a sentence.</h2>
        <p class="br-p br-s12">It is a word, not an acronym, and it is the command you type. The two products beside it keep the name of the thing they stand in for.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="br-grid br-s13">
        <div class="br-card br-s14">
          <div class="br-word"><img class="br-s15" src="/brand/doze.svg" alt=""><b class="br-s16">doze</b></div>
          <p class="br-p">The local-development tool: the app, the CLI and doze.hcl. Repo <code class="br-s17">doze-dev/doze</code>.</p>
          <div class="br-say br-say-no"><small>Not</small>Doze, DOZE, Doze.dev, the Doze CLI</div>
        </div>
        <div class="br-card br-s14">
          <div class="br-word"><img class="br-s15" src="/brand/doze-aws.svg" alt=""><b class="br-s16">doze AWS</b></div>
          <p class="br-p">The local AWS emulator. Repo and binary keep the hyphen: <code class="br-s17">doze-aws</code>.</p>
          <div class="br-say br-say-no"><small>Not</small>doze-aws in prose, Doze AWS, doze aws, dozeAWS</div>
        </div>
        <div class="br-card br-s14">
          <div class="br-word"><img class="br-s15" src="/brand/doze-kafka.svg" alt=""><b class="br-s16">doze Kafka</b></div>
          <p class="br-p">The Kafka broker in one Go binary. Repo and binary: <code class="br-s17">doze-kafka</code>.</p>
          <div class="br-say br-say-no"><small>Not</small>doze-kafka in prose, Doze Kafka, doze kafka</div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <p class="br-p br-dim br-s18">Hyphens belong to code: repos, binaries, package names. In a sentence, write the name with a space. AWS and Kafka are trademarks of their owners; doze AWS and doze Kafka speak their protocols and are not affiliated with them.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Icons -->
  <section class="br-wrap br-sec br-s10">
    <div class="br-s19">
      <span class="br-eyebrow">The icons</span>
      <h2 class="br-h2">A sleeping bat on a tile, one colour per product.</h2>
      <p class="br-p br-s12">Asleep until something needs it: that is the product, and the bat is the whole joke. All three are traced from one bat, so they sit together in a dock or a row of tabs. What it hangs from tells you which one it is.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="br-grid br-s20">
      <figure class="br-icon-card br-s21">
        <div class="br-icon-stage br-s22"><img class="br-s23" src="/brand/doze.svg" alt="The doze icon at large size: a bat asleep on a branch with z's, on an amber tile"></div>
        <div class="br-sizes" aria-label="doze icon at 64, 32 and 16 pixels">
          <div class="br-s24"><img class="br-s25" src="/brand/doze.svg" alt=""><img class="br-s26" src="/brand/doze.svg" alt=""><img class="br-s27" src="/brand/doze.svg" alt=""></div>
          <div class="br-s28"><img class="br-s25" src="/brand/doze.svg" alt=""><img class="br-s26" src="/brand/doze.svg" alt=""><img class="br-s27" src="/brand/doze.svg" alt=""></div>
        </div>
        <figcaption class="br-s29">
          <b class="br-h3 br-s30">doze</b>
          <span class="br-p br-s18">Hangs from a branch, with z's. Bat <code class="br-s17">#3A2448</code> on tile <code class="br-s17">#F0A24B</code>.</span>
          <span class="br-meta">64 · 32 · 16 px, on daylight and night</span>
        </figcaption>
      </figure>
      <figure class="br-icon-card br-s21">
        <div class="br-icon-stage br-s31"><img class="br-s23" src="/brand/doze-aws.svg" alt="The doze AWS icon at large size: a bat asleep on a cloud marked AWS, on a sky-blue tile"></div>
        <div class="br-sizes" aria-label="doze AWS icon at 64, 32 and 16 pixels">
          <div class="br-s24"><img class="br-s25" src="/brand/doze-aws.svg" alt=""><img class="br-s26" src="/brand/doze-aws.svg" alt=""><img class="br-s27" src="/brand/doze-aws.svg" alt=""></div>
          <div class="br-s28"><img class="br-s25" src="/brand/doze-aws.svg" alt=""><img class="br-s26" src="/brand/doze-aws.svg" alt=""><img class="br-s27" src="/brand/doze-aws.svg" alt=""></div>
        </div>
        <figcaption class="br-s29">
          <b class="br-h3 br-s30">doze AWS</b>
          <span class="br-p br-s18">Hangs from a cloud marked AWS; the letters are Poppins Bold turned to outlines, so no font is needed. Bat <code class="br-s17">#1F2A44</code> on <code class="br-s17">#5BB8E8</code>.</span>
          <span class="br-meta">64 · 32 · 16 px, on daylight and night</span>
        </figcaption>
      </figure>
      <figure class="br-icon-card br-s21">
        <div class="br-icon-stage br-s32"><img class="br-s23" src="/brand/doze-kafka.svg" alt="The doze Kafka icon at large size: a bat asleep on a branch grown ring nodes, on a yellow tile"></div>
        <div class="br-sizes" aria-label="doze Kafka icon at 64, 32 and 16 pixels">
          <div class="br-s24"><img class="br-s25" src="/brand/doze-kafka.svg" alt=""><img class="br-s26" src="/brand/doze-kafka.svg" alt=""><img class="br-s27" src="/brand/doze-kafka.svg" alt=""></div>
          <div class="br-s28"><img class="br-s25" src="/brand/doze-kafka.svg" alt=""><img class="br-s26" src="/brand/doze-kafka.svg" alt=""><img class="br-s27" src="/brand/doze-kafka.svg" alt=""></div>
        </div>
        <figcaption class="br-s29">
          <b class="br-h3 br-s30">doze Kafka</b>
          <span class="br-p br-s18">The branch has grown ring nodes: a log of messages. Bat <code class="br-s17">#16150F</code> on <code class="br-s17">#FFD60A</code>.</span>
          <span class="br-meta">64 · 32 · 16 px, on daylight and night</span>
        </figcaption>
      </figure>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Logo do / don't -->
  <section class="br-s9">
    <div class="br-wrap br-sec br-s33">
      <div class="br-s11">
        <span class="br-eyebrow">Using the icon</span>
        <h2 class="br-h2">Use it as it comes. The tile is part of it.</h2>
        <p class="br-p br-s12">The bat is drawn to read at 16 px on its tile. Take it off the tile, recolour it or squash it and it stops reading as ours.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="br-grid br-s34">
        <div class="br-dd">
          <div class="br-dd-stage"><img class="br-s35" src="/brand/doze.svg" alt=""></div>
          <div class="br-dd-cap"><svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#8BE39B" stroke-width="2.4" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12l5 5L20 7"/></svg><span><b class="br-s36">Do</b> leave a quarter of its width clear on every side.</span></div>
        </div>
        <div class="br-dd">
          <div class="br-dd-stage br-s37"><img class="br-s38" src="/brand/doze.svg" alt=""><b class="br-s39">doze</b></div>
          <div class="br-dd-cap"><svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#8BE39B" stroke-width="2.4" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12l5 5L20 7"/></svg><span><b class="br-s36">Do</b> set the name beside it in Bricolage Grotesque 700, lower case, as the site header does.</span></div>
        </div>
        <div class="br-dd">
          <div class="br-dd-stage br-s24"><img class="br-s40" src="/brand/doze.svg" alt=""></div>
          <div class="br-dd-cap"><svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#8BE39B" stroke-width="2.4" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12l5 5L20 7"/></svg><span><b class="br-s36">Do</b> use the same file on light and dark. It carries its own tile.</span></div>
        </div>
        <div class="br-dd">
          <div class="br-dd-stage"><img class="br-s41" src="/brand/doze.svg" alt=""></div>
          <div class="br-dd-cap"><svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#FF9AA8" stroke-width="2.4" stroke-linecap="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M6 6l12 12M18 6L6 18"/></svg><span><b class="br-s42">Don't</b> recolour it. Each colour means a product.</span></div>
        </div>
        <div class="br-dd">
          <div class="br-dd-stage"><img class="br-s43" src="/brand/doze.svg" alt=""></div>
          <div class="br-dd-cap"><svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#FF9AA8" stroke-width="2.4" stroke-linecap="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M6 6l12 12M18 6L6 18"/></svg><span><b class="br-s42">Don't</b> stretch, squash or rotate it. A bat hangs straight down.</span></div>
        </div>
        <div class="br-dd">
          <div class="br-dd-stage br-s37"><img class="br-s44" src="/brand/doze.svg" alt=""><b class="br-s45">DOZE</b></div>
          <div class="br-dd-cap"><svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#FF9AA8" stroke-width="2.4" stroke-linecap="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M6 6l12 12M18 6L6 18"/></svg><span><b class="br-s42">Don't</b> add outlines, glows or shadows, or set the name in capitals or another face.</span></div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Colour -->
  <section class="br-wrap br-sec br-s46">
    <div class="br-s19">
      <span class="br-eyebrow">Colour</span>
      <h2 class="br-h2">Night and a lamp. Daylight where you read and copy.</h2>
      <p class="br-p br-s12">Marketing pages are dark: a room at night with one amber lamp on. The docs and the registry are daylight, because you read them for an hour and copy from them.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="br-s14">
      <h3 class="br-h3 br-s47">Night <span class="br-dim br-s48">marketing pages</span></h3>
      <div class="br-grid br-s49">
        <div class="br-sw"><div class="br-sw-fill br-s50">Aa</div><div class="br-sw-txt"><b>Ground</b><code>#140C1B</code></div></div>
        <div class="br-sw"><div class="br-sw-fill br-s51">Aa</div><div class="br-sw-txt"><b>Raised</b><code>#1A1022 · #1E1328</code></div></div>
        <div class="br-sw"><div class="br-sw-fill br-s52">Aa</div><div class="br-sw-txt"><b>Lines</b><code>#2E1F3A · #34233F · #4A3458</code></div></div>
        <div class="br-sw"><div class="br-sw-fill br-s53">Aa</div><div class="br-sw-txt"><b>Text</b><code>#F4ECE4</code></div></div>
        <div class="br-sw"><div class="br-sw-fill br-s54">Aa</div><div class="br-sw-txt"><b>Secondary</b><code>#C9BAD3 · #D6C8DF</code></div></div>
        <div class="br-sw"><div class="br-sw-fill br-s55">Aa</div><div class="br-sw-txt"><b>Dim</b><code>#9C8AAB</code></div></div>
        <div class="br-sw"><div class="br-sw-fill br-s56">Aa</div><div class="br-sw-txt"><b>Lamp</b><code>#F0A24B</code><span>Buttons, with ink #2A1534</span></div></div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="br-s14">
      <h3 class="br-h3 br-s47">Daylight <span class="br-dim br-s48">docs and the registry</span></h3>
      <div class="br-grid br-s49">
        <div class="br-sw"><div class="br-sw-fill br-s57">Aa</div><div class="br-sw-txt"><b>Ground</b><code>#FFFAF4</code></div></div>
        <div class="br-sw"><div class="br-sw-fill br-s58">Aa</div><div class="br-sw-txt"><b>Panel · sunk</b><code>#FFFFFF · #FFF4E8</code></div></div>
        <div class="br-sw"><div class="br-sw-fill br-s59">Aa</div><div class="br-sw-txt"><b>Lines</b><code>#EADFD3 · #DCCFC2</code></div></div>
        <div class="br-sw"><div class="br-sw-fill br-s60">Aa</div><div class="br-sw-txt"><b>Ink</b><code>#140C1B</code></div></div>
        <div class="br-sw"><div class="br-sw-fill br-s61">Aa</div><div class="br-sw-txt"><b>Secondary · dim</b><code>#4A3D55 · #6E5F79</code></div></div>
        <div class="br-sw"><div class="br-sw-fill br-s62">Aa</div><div class="br-sw-txt"><b>Link amber</b><code>#A85A0C</code><span>Text on white. Plain lamp is for fills.</span></div></div>
        <div class="br-sw"><div class="br-sw-fill br-s63">$ doze up</div><div class="br-sw-txt"><b>Code</b><code>#1E1328 · #F4ECE4</code><span>Code stays dark in daylight</span></div></div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="br-grid br-s64">
      <div class="br-s14">
        <h3 class="br-h3 br-s47">Products</h3>
        <div class="br-grid br-s65">
          <div class="br-sw"><div class="br-sw-fill br-s66">doze</div><div class="br-sw-txt"><code>#F0A24B</code><span>bat #3A2448</span></div></div>
          <div class="br-sw"><div class="br-sw-fill br-s67">AWS</div><div class="br-sw-txt"><code>#5BB8E8</code><span>on navy #0C1320</span></div></div>
          <div class="br-sw"><div class="br-sw-fill br-s68">Kafka</div><div class="br-sw-txt"><code>#FFD60A</code><span>on #16150F</span></div></div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="br-s14">
        <h3 class="br-h3 br-s47">Status</h3>
        <div class="br-grid br-s69">
          <div class="br-sw"><div class="br-sw-fill br-s70">Current</div><div class="br-sw-txt"><b>Good, daylight</b><code>#1D7A45 on #E6F4EA</code></div></div>
          <div class="br-sw"><div class="br-sw-fill br-s71">Deprecated</div><div class="br-sw-txt"><b>Warn, daylight</b><code>#8A5300 on #FFF1D6</code></div></div>
          <div class="br-sw"><div class="br-sw-fill br-s72">Yanked</div><div class="br-sw-txt"><b>Bad, daylight</b><code>#B4233C on #FCE8EC</code></div></div>
          <div class="br-sw"><div class="br-sw-fill br-s73">Coming</div><div class="br-sw-txt"><b>Info, daylight</b><code>#2F62D9 on #E8EEFC</code></div></div>
          <div class="br-sw"><div class="br-sw-fill br-s74">awake</div><div class="br-sw-txt"><b>Good, night</b><code>#8BE39B on #140C1B</code></div></div>
          <div class="br-sw"><div class="br-sw-fill br-s75">crashed</div><div class="br-sw-txt"><b>Bad, night</b><code>#FF9AA8 on #140C1B</code></div></div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Type -->
  <section class="br-s9">
    <div class="br-wrap br-sec br-s33">
      <div class="br-s11">
        <span class="br-eyebrow">Type</span>
        <h2 class="br-h2">Three faces, all free, all from Google Fonts.</h2>
      </div>
      <div class="br-grid br-s76">
        <div class="br-spec br-s77">
          <span class="br-meta">Bricolage Grotesque · 800 · −0.04em at display sizes · headlines</span>
          <p class="br-big-word br-s78">Asleep until your code calls.</p>
          <p class="br-s79">700 for card titles and the name: doze, doze AWS, doze Kafka</p>
        </div>
        <div class="br-spec">
          <span class="br-meta">Geist · 400 / 500 / 600 · body, UI</span>
          <p class="br-s80">Every service gets a name and an address of its own. Two projects, both on 5432, no clash.</p>
          <p class="br-s81">600 for buttons and labels. Body text 15 px and up; small text never under 13 px.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="br-spec">
          <span class="br-meta">JetBrains Mono · 400 / 600 · code, commands, eyebrows</span>
          <pre class="br-s82"><span class="br-s83">$</span> doze up
<span class="br-s83">○</span> gateway  asleep</pre>
          <span class="br-eyebrow">Eyebrows: mono, 13 px, +0.14em</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Voice -->
  <section id="voice" class="br-wrap br-sec br-s10">
    <div class="br-s19">
      <span class="br-eyebrow">Voice</span>
      <h2 class="br-h2">Say the problem first. Then the fix, plainly.</h2>
      <p class="br-p br-s12">People come to doze because something hurts: fans, ports, a setup doc that worked once. Name that, then say what doze does about it, in the fewest exact words.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="br-rule-row">
      <div class="br-s84">
        <b class="br-s85">1. Problem first</b>
        <div class="br-say br-say-yes"><small>Write</small>Port 5432 is already taken. Every service gets an address of its own, so two projects can both use it.</div>
        <div class="br-say br-say-no"><small>Not</small>doze offers a revolutionary, seamless networking experience.</div>
      </div>
      <div class="br-s84">
        <b class="br-s85">2. Numbers over adjectives</b>
        <div class="br-say br-say-yes"><small>Write</small>Services go to sleep after 2 minutes with nothing connected.</div>
        <div class="br-say br-say-no"><small>Not</small>Blazing fast, incredibly lightweight, ultra efficient.</div>
      </div>
      <div class="br-s84">
        <b class="br-s85">3. Only what is true</b>
        <div class="br-say br-say-yes"><small>Write</small>No telemetry, so we can't tell you how many people use it.</div>
        <div class="br-say br-say-no"><small>Not</small>Trusted by thousands of teams. (Unknown numbers stay in brackets until they are known.)</div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="br-card br-s86">
      <div class="br-s87">
        <h3 class="br-h3">The sleep words</h3>
        <p class="br-p">doze has one metaphor and keeps to it. A service is <b class="br-s88">asleep</b>, <b class="br-s88">dozing</b> or <b class="br-s88">awake</b>; it <b class="br-s88">wakes</b> on a connection and goes to <b class="br-s88">sleep</b> when nothing needs it.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="br-s84">
        <span class="br-meta">Use</span>
        <div class="br-s89"><span class="br-chip br-chip-good">wake</span><span class="br-chip br-chip-good">awake</span><span class="br-chip br-chip-good">dozing</span><span class="br-chip br-chip-good">asleep</span><span class="br-chip br-chip-good">sleep</span></div>
        <span class="br-meta br-s90">Never</span>
        <div class="br-s89"><span class="br-chip br-chip-bad"><s>reap</s></span><span class="br-chip br-chip-bad"><s>idle timeout</s></span><span class="br-chip br-chip-bad"><s>spin up</s></span></div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <p class="br-p br-dim br-s18">And: no invented customers, quotes, logos, download or star counts, or benchmark numbers. A benchmark we publish names the machine, the versions, the date and the command to run it yourself.</p>
  </section>

  <!-- Assets -->
  <section class="br-s91" id="assets">
    <div class="br-wrap br-sec br-s92">
      <div class="br-stack-sm br-s93">
        <div class="br-s94">
          <span class="br-eyebrow">Downloads</span>
          <h2 class="br-h2">The files.</h2>
          <p class="br-p br-s12">SVG for anything that scales; PNG where SVG isn't allowed. The source lives in the website repo, under <code class="br-s17">brand/</code>.</p>
        </div>
        <span class="br-off br-s95" aria-disabled="true">Source on GitHub [not public yet]</span>
      </div>
      <div class="br-card br-s96">
        <div class="br-asset">
          <img class="br-s97" src="/brand/doze.svg" alt="">
          <div><b class="br-s98">doze</b><div class="br-meta">doze.svg · PNG 512, 256, 64</div></div>
          <div class="br-asset-links"><a href="/brand/doze.svg" download="">SVG</a><span class="br-off" aria-disabled="true">PNG [not built yet]</span></div>
        </div>
        <div class="br-asset">
          <img class="br-s97" src="/brand/doze-aws.svg" alt="">
          <div><b class="br-s98">doze AWS</b><div class="br-meta">doze-aws.svg · PNG 512, 256, 64</div></div>
          <div class="br-asset-links"><a href="/brand/doze-aws.svg" download="">SVG</a><span class="br-off" aria-disabled="true">PNG [not built yet]</span></div>
        </div>
        <div class="br-asset">
          <img class="br-s97" src="/brand/doze-kafka.svg" alt="">
          <div><b class="br-s98">doze Kafka</b><div class="br-meta">doze-kafka.svg · PNG 512, 256, 64</div></div>
          <div class="br-asset-links"><a href="/brand/doze-kafka.svg" download="">SVG</a><span class="br-off" aria-disabled="true">PNG [not built yet]</span></div>
        </div>
        <div class="br-asset">
          <div class="br-s99" aria-hidden="true"><svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#C9BAD3" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M12 3v12M7 10l5 5 5-5M5 21h14"/></svg></div>
          <div><b class="br-s98">Everything</b><div class="br-meta">All three icons, SVG and PNG, with this page's colours</div></div>
          <div class="br-asset-links"><span class="br-off" aria-disabled="true">doze-brand.zip [not built yet]</span></div>
        </div>
      </div>
